data/raw/*
data/processed/*.parquet
data/processed/reject/
models/*.joblib
.ipynb_checkpoints/
__pycache__/
.venv/
.DS_Store

!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/processed/.gitkeep

# exception: the final model is versioned (4 MB) so that CI/Docker and "clone and run"
# work on a clean checkout. The logistic baseline stays ignored (not used by the API).
!models/xgb_final.joblib
# marts: the four dimension CSVs ARE versioned (195 rows total) because they are small,
# readable in a diff, and document the model without needing the data. The fact table is
# not, for the same reason as the other processed parquets.
data/marts/*.parquet
data/marts/*_sample.csv

# Internal working notes stay local: anything under _processo_interno/ or named _interno_*
# is never versioned. The repository holds results, code and their documentation.
_processo_interno/
_interno_*
**/_interno_*
# Local instructions for the coding assistant (versioned until 2026-09-30, local since).
CLAUDE.md
